er ferry fire accident that occurred off the coast of the Province of Palawan, the Republic of the Philippines, on September 9, I express my deepest condolences to those who lost their lives and my sincere sympathies to the bereaved families. I wish for https://t.co/ygu9DRAQ1Q","id_str":"2098616962922447063","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":10,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"303735625"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTg2MTY5NjI4NTExODA1NDQ=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"In the wake of the passenger ferry fire accident that occurred off the coast of the Province of Palawan, the Republic of the Philippines, on September 9, I express my deepest condolences to those who lost their lives and my sincere sympathies to the bereaved families. I wish for the earliest possible search and rescue of those still missing. Japan expresses its strong solidarity with the Filipino people."}}},"rest_id":"2098616962922447063","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"16228","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2098617636729102538","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"12304","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}}],"metadata":{"conversationMetadata":{"allTweetIds":["2098616292588896353","2098617636729102538"],"enableDeduplication":true}}},"entryId":"list-conversation-2099382174250696756","sortIndex":"2099382174250696652"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemConte